# OpenGuide AI Studio - Environment Configuration Template
# Governed by the $0 Rule: Zero paid external APIs or backend infrastructure.
# All foundational compute (Pyodide CPython, WebGL/WebGPU, IndexedDB) executes 100% locally in the browser.
# DO NOT COMMIT REAL API KEYS OR PRODUCTION TOKENS TO THIS FILE OR TO GIT.

# Deployment & Multi-Remote Sync (Used only in automated release workflows)
GITHUB_PAT_OPEN="ghp_your_github_personal_access_token_here"
GITHUB_PAT_ARD="ghp_your_personal_archive_pat_here"
CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN="cfk_your_cloudflare_pages_api_token_here"

# Client BYOK (Bring Your Own Key) Note:
# Learner API keys for frontier models (OpenAI, Anthropic, Gemini, Groq) are entered
# client-side directly in the browser settings and stored exclusively in private local storage.
# They NEVER transit any intermediate server or backend environment variable.
